WEBVTT

00:00:59.441 --> 00:01:01.441
because it's the patients who are the most in need

00:01:01.441 --> 00:01:02.999
of access to eye care

00:01:02.999 --> 00:01:05.340
who are the least likely to get it.

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:06.446
More people in Kenya,

00:01:06.446 --> 00:01:08.358
and in sub-Saharan Africa,

00:01:08.358 --> 00:01:10.149
have access to a mobile phone

00:01:10.149 --> 00:01:12.302
than they do clean running water.

00:01:12.302 --> 00:01:14.021
So we said, could we harness

00:01:14.021 --> 00:01:15.640
the power of mobile technology

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:17.791
to deliver eye care in a new way?

00:01:17.791 --> 00:01:19.576
And so we developed Peek,

00:01:19.576 --> 00:01:22.114
a smartphone [system] that enables

00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:23.626
community healthcare workers

00:01:23.626 --> 00:01:27.456
and empowers them to deliver eye care everywhere.

00:01:27.456 --> 00:01:30.126
We set about replacing
traditional hospital equipment,